# the panel's lights (ENV): On, then Auto (all out after 30 s untouched, the sleep timer's SEQ too; back at a touch),
# Off (none, a press does not bring them back), On again (they stay); the koto keeps its own lights whatever the setting
wait 800
expect ledFX 1
expect ledENV 1
tap ENV
wait 300
expect ledFX 1
wait 29000
expect ledFX 1
wait 1500
expect ledFX 0
expect ledSEQ 0
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect ledSEQ 2
wait 29000
expect ledSEQ 2
wait 1500
expect ledSEQ 0
tap HOME
wait 300
expect ledFX 1
expect ledSEQ 2
tap ENV
wait 300
expect ledFX 0
expect ledSEQ 0
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect ledFX 0
tap ENV
wait 300
expect ledFX 1
expect ledSEQ 2
wait 31000
expect ledFX 1
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 300
expect ledFX 0
press HOME
wait 1500
release HOME
wait 500
expect ledHOME 2
